linie. 1 Grenze des sog. orientalischen Festlandes.I \\ Grenze der Gebirge Ivanscica und Kalnik. Carbonische Aufbruchslinie. K. Gorjanovic-Kramberger: Die geotektonischen Verhältnisse des Agramer Gebirges. Taf. i. K. Preuß. Akad. d.Wissensch. Anhang z. d. Abh. 1907. Phys.-malh. Abh. ©</i><br>\n<br>\n<b>Note About Images</b><br>\n</p>\n<i>Please note that these images are extracted from scanned page images that may have been digitally enhanced for readability - coloration and appearance of these illustrations may not perfectly resemble the original work.</i>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "1907", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/14776408475/\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/14776408475/</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Source book page: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/stream/abhandlungenderk1907kn/abhandlungenderk1907kn#page/n532/mode/1up\">https://archive.org/stream/abhandlungenderk1907kn/abhandlungenderk1907kn#page/n532/mode/1up</a></li></ul>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "Königlich Preussische Akademie der Wissenschaften zu Berlin", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Permission": {"value": "At the time of upload, the image license was automatically confirmed using the Flickr <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/API\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:API\">API</a>. For more information see <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:F%C3%A6/Flickr_API_detail\" title=\"User:Fæ/Flickr API detail\">Flickr API detail</a>.", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "No restrictions", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "No known copyright restrictions", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "false", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Li